        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>LCN 4011 Standard Regular Arm Mounted Door Closer, LCN \"Smoothee\"</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 4011 Smoothee is a heavy duty, regular arm mounted <b>(Mounts on Pull Side of Door)</b> designed for institutional and other high traffic applications. They are normally thru-bolt mounted with the included Self-Reaming & Tapping Screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handed closer is specifically designed for parallel arm mounting and has passed 10,000,000 cycles in independant testing. UL and ULC listed for self-closing doors without hold-open. Fully adjustable spring rate, closing speed, latch speed and back check.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/interior-door-push-side-mounted-track-closer-lcn-4111t\"><b>LCN 4111T Track Closer</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/lcn-heavy-duty-thru-bolt-parallel-mounted-door-closer-lcn-4111\"><b>LCN 4111 Parallel Arm Closer</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nTested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4, grade one.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features:</b> of LCN 4011 Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Closing Speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Latching Speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Cast Iron Housing</li>\r\n<li>All Weather Fluid</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 250 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 54\" interior / 42\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Handed</li>\r\n<li>Mounted Pull Side of Door</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 (Highest Grade)</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable 1-5</li>\r\n<li>Optional Hold Open Arm</li>\r\n<li>Standard with Cover</li>\r\n<li>30 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4010.pdf?v=1704262241\" target=\"new\"><b>LCN4010  Specifications (PDF).</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-7102-size.gif?v=1704354703\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 4010 series door closer\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer:  \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
